reels.useGuidance:
Intended use (planned, not verified output): this silent 8-second reel is designed as an identity-preservation base reference for Riley. The plan is an opening frontal full-body hold, one even 360-degree camera orbit around a stationary figure, a return frontal hold, and a final frontal face close-up. It is meant to support facial likeness, natural body proportions, front, side and rear silhouettes, the pulled-back hair and ponytail volume, the persistent round wire glasses, and continuity of the plain heathered-grey two-piece base layer.

Limits: the only source is a single frontal photograph. The side and rear views of the hair, ponytail and garments are conservative continuations, not observed detail. The photo shows the hair gathered back into a low ponytail rather than short loose hair tucked behind one ear, and the reel follows the photo. Treat any rear-hair or garment-back detail as provisional. The plan has no articulation, expression changes, speech or alternative outfits, so the reel does not support those uses.

Before reuse, inspect the views that were actually generated. Check that:
- the orbit truly completed and the person stayed still without turning toward the camera;
- the face, glasses and hair match the source in the close-up;
- proportions were not slimmed or altered;
- the outfit stayed consistent with no added logos, fastenings or accessories;
- full-body margins were kept above the hair and below the feet.

Discard or regenerate any view that fails these checks.

